<%- include('_top') %>
<p class="notice">This is template text. Please have your privacy policy reviewed so it accurately reflects how you process data (UK GDPR).</p>
<h2>What we collect</h2>
<p>When you order or create an account we collect your name, email, phone number and delivery address. We do not store card details.</p>
<h2>How we use it</h2>
<p>To process and deliver orders, provide customer service, and – only if you opt in – send marketing emails, which you can unsubscribe from at any time.</p>
<h2>Cookies</h2>
<p>We use one essential cookie to keep your basket and sign-in session. We do not use advertising cookies.</p>
<h2>Your rights</h2>
<p>You can request access to, correction of or deletion of your data by emailing <a href="mailto:<%= settings.store_email %>"><%= settings.store_email %></a>.</p>
